sequenceDiagram
    title SD-8: Recommendation (Course Recommendation & Personal Plan)
    actor Student
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant RS as Recommendation System

    Student->>+FE: Request recommendation
    FE->>+BE: POST /recommendations
    BE->>BE: Verify session & ownership
    BE->>+DB: Get student data, Curriculum, rules
    DB-->>-BE: Student data + Curriculum + rules
    BE->>+RS: recommend(student data, Curriculum, rules)
    RS-->>-BE: Recommendation output
    BE->>+DB: Save recommendation result
    DB-->>-BE: OK
    BE-->>-FE: Recommendation output
    FE-->>-Student: Show recommendation